The page shows the public dataset SharpMeow/first-letters-ink-atlas (https://huggingface.co/datasets/SharpMeow/first-letters-ink-atlas),
read at run time and not stored in this Space. Its maps are model output computed from the Vesuvius Challenge open data
along traced meshes by ketchupbyheinz, so the dataset is derived data under CC BY-NC 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/).

Scan data: Giorgio Angelotti, Stephen Parsons, Sean Johnson, Elian Rafael Dal Prà, Johannes Rudolph, Paul Tafforeau,
Alessandro Mirone, Paul Henderson, Hendrik Schilling, Forrest McDonald, David Josey, Youssef Nader, C. Seth Parker,
W. Brent Seales. Vesuvius Challenge: CT Scans of Herculaneum Papyri. Vesuvius Challenge. https://scrollprize.org/data

Meshes and the face check: ketchupbyheinz, vesuvius-scroll-survey (https://github.com/ketchupbyheinz/vesuvius-scroll-survey;
code MIT, meshes CC BY-NC 4.0) and ScrollPrize/villa PR #2318 (MIT).

Ink models, all MIT: ink_9um and Hecate (Vesuvius Challenge), Reader v2 and Reader V3 (Domenico Russo), dense_native
(Erwin Nieuwlaar), d9v2 (TAUIL-Abd-Elilah). Ensemble recipe: Erwin Nieuwlaar, through LimeGS's ink-sdk.
